sequenceDiagram
    participant Problem as Problem Text
    participant Analyzer as Problem Analyzer
    participant Categories as Category Matcher
    participant Strategies as Strategy Registry
    participant Generator as Prompt Generator
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant Attempts as Attempts Directory

    Note over Categories: ProblemCategory Enum:<br/>- GRID_TRAVERSAL<br/>- PATHFINDING<br/>- SIMULATION<br/>- PATTERN_MATCHING<br/>- STATE_MACHINE<br/>etc...

    Problem->>Analyzer: Problem description
    Analyzer->>Categories: Analyze text for keywords
    
    loop For each category
        Categories->>Categories: Match against CATEGORY_KEYWORDS
    end

    Categories-->>Strategies: Matched categories
    
    loop For each category
        Strategies->>Strategies: Lookup in SOLUTION_STRATEGIES
        Note over Strategies: Strategy contains:<br/>- name<br/>- description<br/>- when_to_use<br/>- key_techniques<br/>- optimization_tips<br/>- example_patterns
    end

    Strategies-->>Generator: Relevant strategies

    Generator->>Generator: get_parsing_guidance()
    Note over Generator: Parsing Guidance:<br/>1. Structure Analysis<br/>2. Data Structure Selection<br/>3. Advanced Parsing (if needed)

    Generator->>Generator: get_strategy_guidance()
    Note over Generator: For each strategy:<br/>1. Purpose<br/>2. Key Techniques<br/>3. Optimization Tips

    Generator->>Generator: get_implementation_requirements()
    Note over Generator: Requirements:<br/>1. Input handling ('input.txt')<br/>2. Data type handling<br/>3. Return value format<br/>4. Error handling<br/>5. Required imports

    Generator->>Generator: Prioritize and combine sections

    loop For each model
        Generator-->>LLM: Final structured prompt
        LLM->>LLM: Generate solution
        LLM->>Attempts: Record attempt immediately
        Note over Attempts: Attempt includes:<br/>1. Model code (using 'input.txt')<br/>2. Prompt used<br/>3. Model info<br/>4. Generation metrics<br/>5. Raw response<br/>6. Applied strategies
    end
